# Line endings.
#
# Everything text is stored with LF in the repository and checked out with
# LF. Without this the tree carries CRLF (Git for Windows' default is
# core.autocrlf=true) and the first contributor on Linux who touches a file
# sends a diff of every line in it, with the real change buried inside.
#
# It also decides what the sdist ships, because `git archive` and the build
# read from the index.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Audio and binaries, untouched.
*.alaw  binary
*.ulaw  binary
*.wav   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ico   binary
